  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Bari (Kitchen Garden) Scheme” launched by the Horticulture and Food Processing Department, Government of Madhya Pradesh, aims to promote kitchen gardening through the free distribution of vegetable seed packets worth ₹75 to poor, small/marginal farmers and agricultural laborers living below the poverty line.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant must be a small or marginal farmer/agricultural laborer.\n  - The applicant must be a resident of Madhya Pradesh.\n  - The applicant must belong to the Below the Poverty Line (BPL) category.\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": null,
